WEBVTT

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:06.600
 We wanted to do things our own way.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.840
 To make something that is better for the farmers,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.240
 our employees, the community, the planet, and you.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:21.120
 We understand that who makes it and where it's from,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.820
 is naturally reflected in the end quality.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.360
 And in order to maintain this standard,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.720
 we needed to build our own supply chain

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.600
 that would allow us to be involved

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.720
 at every step of the process.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.400
 From supporting our farmers,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.720
 through the meticulous craftsmanship of our factories,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.160
 directly to you.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.760
 That's what inspires us and keeps us moving forward.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:51.840
 Being sustainable, organic, safe, and fair trade

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.040
 isn't just seen around our factories and fields,

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.840
 but can be felt in the quality of our foam.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.760
 Earth foam is good to the core.
